What's that's all about?

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:15.580
You think I want to replace you?

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:18.880
You just can't stand taking orders from me, can you?

00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:26.290
Why won't you let me do my job?

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:29.900
