00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:37.680
Azati Prime.

00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:41.010
The coordinates match the location of one of the red giants.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:42.980
Set a course for Azati Prime.

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:44.120
Maximum warp.

00:01:01.470 --> 00:01:02.590
It's definitely Zindi, sir.

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:05.700
The hull composition matches the other ships we've seen.

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:09.030
Doesn't look like a reptilian or a primate design.

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:10.920
Bioscience?

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:12.560
None that I can detect.

00:01:13.370 --> 00:01:14.650
There's no atmosphere aboard.

00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:18.860
Anyone else in the system?

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:20.180
No, sir.

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:23.980
Put a team together.

00:01:24.590 --> 00:01:24.950
Aye, sir.

00:01:31.530 --> 00:01:33.060
It's been a long time

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:58.190
Never die no more

