I

00:03:44.970 --> 00:03:51.400
the back to Enterprise. Tell Phlox I want a complete autopsy. Major and I will search

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:54.410
the port side. See if you can access their ship's database.

00:04:31.530 --> 00:04:31.610
We'll be right back.

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:01.430
It's a computer interface.

00:05:01.970 --> 00:05:02.950
See what you can download.

00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:16.060
He's always filling the house up with bugs he's collected.

00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:18.390
That's my mother crazy.

00:05:20.310 --> 00:05:21.550
Something new for his collection.

00:06:04.990 --> 00:06:07.220
Little stale, but breathable.

00:06:08.890 --> 00:06:11.650
Biosigns, very faint.

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:13.700
Coming from in here.

00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:39.740
dozen particle cannons torpedo launchers are sure you'd better get over sir

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:08.970
The DNA is identical to the bodies we found.

00:07:10.380 --> 00:07:13.030
