00:11:20.290 --> 00:11:22.350
I've got half a mind to take a plasma torch to that place.

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:27.440
What if we found a nursery filled with 31 infant primates?

00:11:28.430 --> 00:11:29.450
Would you want to torch them?

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:34.340
The Zindi are trying to destroy Earth because they heard that humans are ruthless.

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:36.260
This is a chance to prove them wrong.

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:40.000
We can bring the eggs aboard. Reconfigure one of the cargo bays.

00:11:40.180 --> 00:11:41.040
I already talked to Flags.

00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:43.770
He says they're integrated into the hatchery walls.

00:11:43.790 --> 00:11:45.590
If we remove them, they'll die.

00:11:45.810 --> 00:11:48.980
Sir, this is crazy. These people are trying to kill us.

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:50.300
This isn't open for discussion.

00:11:51.920 --> 00:11:53.060
I'll lead the engineering team.

00:11:54.250 --> 00:11:58.030
I need you up here to help Travis figure out how to operate that Zindi shuttle.

00:11:58.610 --> 00:11:58.990
Captain.

00:11:59.680 --> 00:11:59.960
I've made...

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:03.450
my decision. Don't worry.

00:12:30.570 --> 00:12:35.940
They may know how to build a weapons system, but these people could learn a thing or two about designing a comfortable chair.

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:38.880
For an insectoid, maybe they are comfortable.

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:41.780
Power grid doesn't make much sense.

00:12:42.870 --> 00:12:44.570
It's half of its rather destructural integrity.

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:47.840
They'd probably fly this thing inside a gas giant.

00:12:49.130 --> 00:12:50.590
Someone who could figure out how to fly it.

00:12:51.760 --> 00:12:54.700
