No, ma'am.

00:15:37.980 --> 00:15:39.000
Why are you guarding this chamber?

00:15:39.400 --> 00:15:39.880
Captain's orders.

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:14.000
read's report what you requested a tactical analysis of the insectoid ship later are we ready

00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:21.230
just a few seconds captain there are two makers posted outside i asked major hayes to assign them

