Trev, we're ready.

00:16:35.630 --> 00:16:36.750
Start at 40 megajoules.

00:16:37.240 --> 00:16:38.660
Keep an eye on that matrix converter.

00:16:41.070 --> 00:16:41.890
Make it up to 50.

