What happened?

00:17:04.130 --> 00:17:05.430
Must have been a surge in the power grid.

00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:08.400
I'll need a few minutes, Captain.

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:19.120
Retreat Enterprise.

00:17:21.240 --> 00:17:22.000
Medical emergency.

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:49.020
nothing i can do i'm sorry i saw she coming with that translation their iconography is different

