I'm not going to let any more of them die.

00:18:56.620 --> 00:18:59.920
With that reactor running again, we're going to have to use a third of our antimatter.

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:05.410
reserves. Why so much? Every system on that ship is integrated. The only way to bring

