00:19:57.200 --> 00:19:57.440
No.

00:19:59.400 --> 00:19:59.740
Problem.

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:03.770
Initializing their reactor will deplete our reserves by one-third.

00:20:04.030 --> 00:20:07.380
We can spare it. We're only a few light years from the Red Giant.

00:20:08.400 --> 00:20:10.100
We'll still have more than enough fuel to get there.

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:13.680
We don't know for certain if the weapon is in that system.

00:20:16.810 --> 00:20:18.310
There are lives at risk here.

00:20:19.120 --> 00:20:22.420
Billions of lives are at risk on Earth if our mission fails.

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:29.710
I'm well aware of that. These Zindi are innocent.

00:20:31.180 --> 00:20:34.600
If we let them die, we'll be proving to the others that they're right about us.

00:20:37.120 --> 00:20:38.480
