00:22:21.920 --> 00:22:24.110
This is only temporary.

00:22:25.560 --> 00:22:27.120
Paul just needed a slap on the wrist.

00:22:28.260 --> 00:22:29.880
She's questioned your orders lots of times.

00:22:31.180 --> 00:22:33.250
You've never locked her up before.

00:22:34.930 --> 00:22:37.900
You have to admit, it's a lot of the ordinary.

00:22:38.180 --> 00:22:39.660
These aren't ordinary circumstances.

00:22:41.340 --> 00:22:43.380
Paul refused a direct order in front of the crew.

00:22:44.740 --> 00:22:46.780
Can't have senior officers behaving like that.

00:22:47.730 --> 00:22:49.330
Especially on a mission this important.

00:22:52.720 --> 00:22:54.400
Maybe you ought to confine me to quarters too, sir.

00:22:54.540 --> 00:22:58.000
Because I'm still not sure we're doing the right thing here.

00:22:59.420 --> 00:22:59.980
If the rolls...

00:23:00.030 --> 00:23:10.770
reversed i can't imagine this india would do the same for us my great grandfather was in north

