africa during the eugenics wars battalion was evacuating civilians from a war zone when they

00:23:17.440 --> 00:23:22.280
came under attack there was a school full of children directly between them and the enemy

00:23:22.280 --> 00:23:29.000
if his men had returned fire they might have hit it so he called the commander on the other side

00:23:30.160 --> 00:23:35.060
