00:24:49.380 --> 00:24:51.240
I can't say I disagree with the captain's decision.

00:24:52.590 --> 00:24:55.150
If one of my men disobeyed orders, I'd throw him in the stockade.

00:25:00.600 --> 00:25:01.460
I've got to get back to the bridge.

00:25:01.660 --> 00:25:03.800
I mean, now if your simulation finds anything else.

00:25:14.530 --> 00:25:15.290
We need to see T'Pol.

00:25:15.920 --> 00:25:17.300
She's not supposed to have any visitors, sir.

00:25:17.650 --> 00:25:18.610
I'll send in a social call.

00:25:18.710 --> 00:25:19.930
I'm here for my neuro-pressure treatment.

00:25:20.510 --> 00:25:20.910
Doctor's orders.

00:25:23.620 --> 00:25:25.280
You don't want me to bring Phlox down here, do you?

00:25:33.260 --> 00:25:33.760
What's our status?

00:25:34.000 --> 00:25:35.060
The antimatter's on its way.

00:25:35.280 --> 00:25:36.220
I had a talk with him.

00:25:36.920 --> 00:25:37.780
Everything's gonna be alright.

00:25:37.960 --> 00:25:39.740
This whole thing will blow over in a day or two.

00:25:40.310 --> 00:25:42.410
Our antimatter supply will be depleted by then.

00:25:43.490 --> 00:25:47.790
The captain's behavior is becoming increasingly illogical, even for a human.

00:25:49.350 --> 00:25:50.770
He's preoccupied with the hatchery.

00:25:51.230 --> 00:25:52.990
He's displaying signs of paranoia.

00:25:53.110 --> 00:25:55.160
I think you're overstating things just a little.

00:25:55.600 --> 00:25:57.660
You can't allow him to use our antimatter.

00:25:58.490 --> 00:25:59.310
You suggest I do.

00:26:00.250 --> 00:26:00.810
Start a mutiny?

00:26:01.240 --> 00:26:02.480
You have to speak with Phlox.

00:26:03.140 --> 00:26:05.060
Ask him to run a full exam on the captain.

00:26:05.600 --> 00:26:06.600
What good would that do?

00:26:06.800 --> 00:26:10.320
If the doctor can find something wrong, we may have medical grounds to relieve him of

00:26:10.320 --> 00:26:10.640
command.

00:26:11.280 --> 00:26:11.840
Relieve him?

00:26:13.460 --> 00:26:17.940
Look, I know you're upset about what happened, but I think you're taking this personally.

00:26:18.460 --> 00:26:20.120
How long before the reactor's brought online?

00:26:21.740 --> 00:26:25.610
Assuming Hoshi can translate the interface, 12 hours.

00:26:26.330 --> 00:26:28.830
Delay it until we can verify the captain's mental state.

00:26:30.000 --> 00:26:32.680
If he finds out what we're doing, we'll both end up in the brig.

00:26:32.840 --> 00:26:38.540
I need to betray him.

00:26:39.640 --> 00:26:42.700
You can't allow your personal feelings for the captain to affect your decision.

00:26:43.720 --> 00:26:46.900
We both know he's endangering this ship and our mission.

00:26:47.100 --> 00:26:52.840
What is it?

00:26:53.800 --> 00:26:55.980
A subspace vortex is opening off the port bow.

00:26:56.640 --> 00:26:57.300
Tactical alert.

00:26:59.140 --> 00:26:59.880
Captain Archer.

00:27:00.350 --> 00:27:01.150
Report to the bridge.

00:27:08.030 --> 00:27:08.590
Insectoid.

00:27:08.860 --> 00:27:09.840
Three biosigns aboard.

00:27:10.100 --> 00:27:10.700
They're firing.

00:27:15.020 --> 00:27:15.780
Pursuit course.

00:27:17.180 --> 00:27:17.860
Armed face cannons.

00:27:18.500 --> 00:27:19.360
Disable their engines.

00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:31.640
They're charging. They could be trying to open a vortex.

00:27:34.620 --> 00:27:36.080
Torpedoes. Maximum yield.

00:27:36.890 --> 00:27:38.210
Target or impulse manifolds.

00:27:38.830 --> 00:27:40.040
Ready. Fire.

00:27:40.460 --> 00:27:49.100
The hell's going on?

00:27:49.480 --> 00:27:50.660
An insectoid ship, sir.

00:27:53.770 --> 00:27:54.490
You destroyed them?

00:27:55.070 --> 00:27:57.210
They were opening a vortex. They would have escaped.

00:27:58.230 --> 00:27:59.970
The crew might have been able to take care of the head...

00:28:01.020 --> 00:28:05.360
Sir, we could have kept our antimatter and continued the mission.

00:28:05.560 --> 00:28:08.570
They would have told their superiors, sir, given away our position.

00:28:08.790 --> 00:28:12.770
If you'd explained to them why we were here, you might have avoided a firefight.

00:28:13.150 --> 00:28:14.970
With due respect, sir, they...

00:28:15.000 --> 00:28:16.700
didn't seem particularly interested in talking.

00:28:23.720 --> 00:28:25.760
Archer to Major Hayes. Go ahead, Captain.

00:28:25.920 --> 00:28:28.310
Report to my ready room on the double. Aye, sir.

00:28:32.556 --> 00:28:34.116
I'm relieving you as tactical officer.

00:28:35.628 --> 00:28:37.128
From now on, you'll report to Major Hayes.

00:28:38.348 --> 00:28:40.508
I did what was necessary to protect this ship.

00:28:40.908 --> 00:28:41.708
And its mission.

00:28:41.948 --> 00:28:43.788
You'll be confined to quarters until further notice.

00:28:44.652 --> 00:28:45.652
Captain dismissed.

00:28:59.628 --> 00:28:59.928
done with that.

00:29:00.000 --> 00:29:00.320
Translation?

00:29:00.440 --> 00:29:00.800
Almost.

00:29:02.010 --> 00:29:05.170
I want you to put together a distress call in the insectoid language.

00:29:05.940 --> 00:29:07.880
Transmit it on all frequencies as soon as you're ready.

00:29:09.850 --> 00:29:10.250
Understood.

00:29:10.570 --> 00:29:14.880
There's nothing more important than the...

00:29:15.000 --> 00:29:19.700
of this mission. Do you agree, Major? Of course, sir. My senior officers don't seem to understand

00:29:19.700 --> 00:29:26.120
what I'm trying to do here. I guess I have myself to blame. In the past, I've encouraged them to ask

00:29:26.120 --> 00:29:29.970
questions, but we don't have time for that now. I need officers who...

00:29:30.000 --> 00:29:32.220
respect the chain of command, and can follow orders.

00:29:32.380 --> 00:29:33.480
It won't be a problem, sir.

00:29:35.852 --> 00:29:36.572
I thought what happened with.

00:29:37.132 --> 00:29:39.012
have been an isolated incident, but I'm not so sure now.

00:29:41.164 --> 00:29:42.904
Lieutenant Reed destroyed a ship that could have helped us.

00:29:44.492 --> 00:29:47.492
I'm starting to wonder if he deliberately tried to sabotage this mission.

00:29:50.892 --> 00:29:52.252
You're in command while I'm on the surface.

00:29:52.876 --> 00:29:53.596
You answer to me.

00:29:54.060 --> 00:29:55.560
and me alone. Is that understood, Major?

00:29:56.684 --> 00:29:57.304
Perfectly, sir.

00:29:58.092 --> 00:29:58.612
That'll be all.

00:30:10.430 --> 00:30:11.270
Can we talk to you for a minute, sir?

00:30:11.550 --> 00:30:12.620
What is it?

00:30:16.280 --> 00:30:18.240
I'd like you to go to sickbay with Phlox.

00:30:18.400 --> 00:30:20.360
Do I look sick to you?

00:30:21.640 --> 00:30:24.000
Hoshi says you ordered her to transmit a distress call.

00:30:25.930 --> 00:30:26.170
That's right.

00:30:26.350 --> 00:30:28.700
Don't you think that's a little dangerous?

00:30:30.220 --> 00:30:32.500
We'll be light years from here before the Zindi respond to it.

00:30:32.560 --> 00:30:34.980
We don't know how far away their ships are.

00:30:35.080 --> 00:30:37.890
If we send that message, we'll be taking a hell of a risk.

00:30:38.150 --> 00:30:40.460
We can't afford to play it safe anymore.

00:30:40.700 --> 00:30:42.500
This mission's too important.

00:30:42.700 --> 00:30:44.630
This mission is to save Earth.

00:30:46.660 --> 00:30:47.540
on an alien hatchery.

00:30:48.360 --> 00:30:51.280
Captain, you haven't eaten or slept in almost two days.

00:30:51.420 --> 00:30:54.700
You've shown signs of obsessional behavior and paranoia.

00:31:01.372 --> 00:31:02.832
If it'll make the two of you feel better.

00:31:03.708 --> 00:31:05.828
I'll go to sickbay for a complete physical.

00:31:09.244 --> 00:31:10.744
as soon as that reactor's online.

00:31:11.964 --> 00:31:12.804
That's not good enough, sir.

00:31:14.044 --> 00:31:16.044
Vox has the authority to order you to...

00:31:18.844 --> 00:31:20.844
Paul's manipulating you, isn't she?

00:31:21.500 --> 00:31:23.800
If I'm declared unfit for duty, then she takes over.

00:31:24.092 --> 00:31:29.692
Captain, if you won't come with me, I'll be required under Starfleet Order 104, Section C, to relieve you of command.

00:31:30.000 --> 00:31:35.420
I expected something like this from her, not from the two of you.

00:31:36.460 --> 00:31:42.160
Corporal, I've already confined two senior officers today.

00:31:58.530 --> 00:31:59.670
Well, chemistry appears normal.

00:32:00.540 --> 00:32:01.400
There's nothing wrong with him?

00:32:01.850 --> 00:32:03.310
The scan is hardly conclusive.

00:32:03.470 --> 00:32:06.570
I'll need to get him into the imaging chamber and run a complete neurological series.

00:32:07.360 --> 00:32:11.580
When Hoshi sends that distress call, every Zindi ship that picks it up will start heading this way.

00:32:14.850 --> 00:32:15.610
He's on the bridge.

00:32:16.390 --> 00:32:17.590
Mako's posted all over the ship.

00:32:20.450 --> 00:32:21.710
We do. We're going to have to do it fast.

00:32:21.870 --> 00:32:24.900
What are you proposing, Commander?

00:32:25.280 --> 00:32:29.100
I think it's time we throw the rulebook out the window.

00:32:41.230 --> 00:32:41.490
Captain.

00:32:57.430 --> 00:32:58.270
Is there no visitors?

00:32:58.490 --> 00:32:59.710
Ah, you let me in to four.

00:33:00.000 --> 00:33:05.160
have new orders for Major Hayes. Look, Paul was a little rough with me during the last session.

00:33:05.790 --> 00:33:09.860
At least you caused some nerve damage. You'll have to speak with the Major, sir. This is a start

00:33:09.860 --> 00:33:14.520
fleet trip. I don't have to ask Major Hayes for anything. Step away, sir. Oh, stand down, Corporal.

00:33:15.240 --> 00:33:23.420
He gave Hayes control of the bridge, posted Makos on every deck. Is he still on the surface? Yep.

00:33:23.850 --> 00:33:27.700
Retrieving him and the antimatter should be the priority. I'd advise securing the bridge first.

00:33:28.180 --> 00:33:29.920
If Hayes gets wind of this, we could have a fire.

00:33:30.000 --> 00:33:33.780
fight on our hands. Perhaps we should approach the Major and explain the situation. He seems like a

00:33:33.780 --> 00:33:38.250
reasonable man. That would be risky. If Hayes sides with the Captain, this mutiny will be over

00:33:38.250 --> 00:33:44.160
before it begins. We'll need more people. Who's on duty in the armory? Ensign Walsh and two of my

00:33:44.160 --> 00:33:55.620
men. They'll side with us, but Hayes posted to Mako there. Make the shuttle plot back to Enterprise.

00:33:57.020 --> 00:33:58.640
What about you, sir? You heard me!

00:34:21.240 --> 00:34:21.420
Cheers.

00:34:30.160 --> 00:34:30.580
Yes, sir.

00:35:00.000 --> 00:35:00.200
Bye-bye.

00:36:02.270 --> 00:36:02.510
Go ahead.

00:36:03.040 --> 00:36:06.360
Major, Corporal Chang's been found unconscious in DePaul's quarters.

00:36:06.910 --> 00:36:07.750
Where's DePaul?

00:36:08.090 --> 00:36:08.810
Not here, sir.

00:36:10.490 --> 00:36:11.290
Haze to the armory.

00:36:14.380 --> 00:36:15.460
Armory, respond.

00:36:29.210 --> 00:36:29.890
Can they shoot me, Lieutenant?

00:36:30.670 --> 00:36:32.030
Tell them to stand down.

00:36:32.250 --> 00:36:33.670
The captain relieved you of duty.

00:36:34.690 --> 00:36:35.390
Both of you.

00:36:35.700 --> 00:36:36.880
We don't want anyone injured.

00:36:37.380 --> 00:36:38.340
Put down your weapons.

00:36:38.820 --> 00:36:40.340
Until the captain says otherwise,

00:36:41.120 --> 00:36:42.640
I give the orders on this bridge.

00:36:42.840 --> 00:36:54.440
Go back to the ship, guys.

00:37:01.820 --> 00:37:02.080
God!

00:37:31.660 --> 00:37:33.360
I gave you a direct order, Ensign.

00:37:35.760 --> 00:37:36.500
I'm sorry, Major.

00:38:06.650 --> 00:38:07.470
Take him to his quarters.

00:38:07.880 --> 00:38:08.440
Aye, sir.

00:38:10.810 --> 00:38:12.190
Commander Tucker, put him through.

00:38:13.050 --> 00:38:13.530
Go ahead.

00:38:14.100 --> 00:38:14.820
We've got the captain.

00:38:15.000 --> 00:38:16.180
What's going on up there?

00:38:17.300 --> 00:38:18.220
The bridge is secure.

00:38:18.970 --> 00:38:20.650
Tell Phlox to get the imaging chamber ready.

00:38:22.260 --> 00:38:23.260
We've got a patient for him.

00:38:26.980 --> 00:38:28.860
Captain Captain Starlog Supplemental.

00:38:29.540 --> 00:38:29.960
We've res...

00:38:30.000 --> 00:38:31.460
We doomed our course for Zoddy Prime.

00:38:32.160 --> 00:38:35.160
Major Hayes and his men have been temporarily relieved of duty.

00:38:35.560 --> 00:38:38.760
Dr. Phlox believes he has found an explanation for the captain's behavior.

00:38:40.110 --> 00:38:40.630
Where is he?

00:38:42.170 --> 00:38:43.510
In his quarters, resting.

00:38:45.170 --> 00:38:48.940
Do you recall when the captain was attacked by one of the eggs?

00:38:49.590 --> 00:38:51.130
It sprayed something in his face.

00:38:51.480 --> 00:38:57.060
I thought it was a defense reflex, but it was actually something far more sophisticated.

00:38:57.730 --> 00:38:59.670
The substance contained a unique neurochemical.

00:39:00.190 --> 00:39:06.490
It infiltrated the captain's synaptic pathways, causing him to reverse imprint on the baby insectoids.

00:39:06.890 --> 00:39:11.460
It's the opposite of what happens when a young animal bonds with its mother.

00:39:12.580 --> 00:39:14.640
You're saying he thought he was the mother of those things?

00:39:15.390 --> 00:39:16.690
More like their caretaker.

00:39:17.120 --> 00:39:19.160
Of course, the captain didn't realize this on a conscious level.

00:39:19.700 --> 00:39:23.980
Eventually, he became obsessed with protecting the eggs to be exclusion of everything else.

00:39:24.530 --> 00:39:25.510
Including our mission.

00:39:27.760 --> 00:39:29.220
I'd like to speak with him, if you don't mind.

00:39:30.090 --> 00:39:32.910
He'll be awake in a few hours. He should be fully recovered by then.

00:39:34.960 --> 00:39:36.800
I want you and your men to return to duty.

00:39:38.000 --> 00:39:38.400
Yes, ma'am.

00:39:46.280 --> 00:39:48.000
The sort of thing they trained us for at West Point.

00:39:49.580 --> 00:39:50.180
Imagine not.

00:39:53.180 --> 00:39:53.920
He could have come to me.

00:39:54.830 --> 00:39:55.810
Explain the situation.

00:39:58.030 --> 00:39:59.970
Couldn't take the chance that you'd side with the camera.

00:40:00.060 --> 00:40:04.040
and probably would have.

00:40:15.690 --> 00:40:22.750
I didn't mean to wake you, sir.

00:40:23.730 --> 00:40:24.910
It's all right. I was getting up anyway.

00:40:26.690 --> 00:40:27.230
How are you feeling?

00:40:28.260 --> 00:40:28.860
Oh, I've been better.

00:40:30.956 --> 00:40:32.656
You sure you heard that pistol set stun?

00:40:33.868 --> 00:40:34.708
I can't.

00:40:38.060 --> 00:40:40.820
I hope you understand if there'd been any other way.

00:40:41.292 --> 00:40:42.792
You're protecting our mission, Tripp.

00:40:44.044 --> 00:40:45.164
I would have done the same thing.

00:40:45.868 --> 00:40:46.708
Still.

00:40:47.148 --> 00:40:49.188
I never thought I'd find myself pointing a weapon at you.

00:40:50.028 --> 00:40:51.288
No matter what the circumstances.

00:40:52.588 --> 00:40:53.888
Let's put this behind us.

00:40:54.348 --> 00:40:55.188
Okay?

00:40:56.524 --> 00:40:56.764
Yes, sir.

00:40:59.692 --> 00:40:59.872
are

00:41:00.000 --> 00:41:03.260
We just recovered the last of our antimatter reserves.

00:41:05.820 --> 00:41:06.120
Excellent.

00:41:07.340 --> 00:41:10.000
Flock says there's 19 of them running around down there.

00:41:11.420 --> 00:41:14.140
Chances are they'll survive until the next Zindi ship comes along.

00:41:15.830 --> 00:41:16.950
It's time we got back on the road.

00:41:18.930 --> 00:41:19.770
I want you at your post.

00:41:20.770 --> 00:41:22.430
We're gonna be pushing the engines pretty hard.

00:41:23.400 --> 00:41:24.360
I'll be on the bridge.

00:41:25.090 --> 00:41:26.290
Are you supposed to get some rest?

00:41:26.990 --> 00:41:27.630
Oh, that plenty.

00:41:29.700 --> 00:41:29.940
I'm sorry.

00:41:30.000 --> 00:41:32.680
Sorry, sir, but the doctor was insistent.

00:41:32.700 --> 00:41:39.740
Okay, I guess I don't want another mutiny on my hands.

00:41:39.860 --> 00:41:44.020
Tell Travis to set a course for Zotti Prime, maximum.

00:41:44.640 --> 00:41:44.920
Right away.

00:41:45.000 --> 00:41:45.160
sir
